WEBVTT

00:00:15.165 --> 00:00:21.075
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.075 --> 00:00:26.845
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.845 --> 00:00:32.615
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:37.555
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.555 --> 00:00:43.395
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.395 --> 00:00:50.075
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.075 --> 00:00:55.775
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.775 --> 00:01:00.945
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.945 --> 00:01:06.755
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.755 --> 00:01:13.265
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.265 --> 00:01:18.935
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.935 --> 00:01:24.075
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.075 --> 00:01:27.835
Shine the light!

00:01:33.519 --> 00:01:35.919
Were you the one who killed Keisei?!

00:01:41.929 --> 00:01:44.029
It's not just regrets.

00:01:44.029 --> 00:01:49.199
I hold guns for the
reason I decided... for Keisei!

00:01:51.809 --> 00:01:53.929
I am a Shikabane Hime!

00:02:02.179 --> 00:02:05.679
Well then, both of you,
change into your new training outfits!

00:02:08.659 --> 00:02:12.189
We're changing in the same place?!

00:02:12.189 --> 00:02:14.699
This isn't good.
This really doesn't seem good...

00:02:14.699 --> 00:02:17.169
And she's already started taking
off her clothes without any hesitation.

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:19.689
Well, since we have to change,
that's not strange, but...

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:25.569
What? What's the matter?

00:02:27.539 --> 00:02:30.649
Well, since it seems we're
starting on our real training now,

00:02:30.649 --> 00:02:33.349
I thought I'd get myself psyched up first.

00:02:33.349 --> 00:02:34.479
You sure are positive...

00:02:34.479 --> 00:02:35.749
What?

00:02:35.749 --> 00:02:38.149
I thought you'd be more down.

00:02:41.319 --> 00:02:44.849
I've already... cried so much...

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:49.729
I cried so much that I wouldn't want you
to see me like that... I cried like a child...

00:02:49.729 --> 00:02:53.169
"Carefully prepared by Keisei Tagami"
"Super special stew"
I cried so much that I wouldn't want you
to see me like that... I cried like a child...

00:02:53.169 --> 00:02:54.599
"Carefully prepared by Keisei Tagami"
"Super special stew"
My nose was running all over...

00:02:54.599 --> 00:02:55.599
My nose was running all over...

00:02:55.599 --> 00:03:01.009
So... maybe you might wanna...
cry more, too.

00:03:02.239 --> 00:03:04.869
No matter how much I cry...

00:03:05.409 --> 00:03:07.779
I can't forget...

00:03:14.919 --> 00:03:17.359
Gee... you got shot down but good.

00:03:17.359 --> 00:03:20.949
Hm?! That voice... If I'm not mistaken...

00:03:21.729 --> 00:03:22.099
Ahh!

00:03:22.099 --> 00:03:23.619
I'm Saki Amase.

00:03:25.969 --> 00:03:28.439
You can call me Saki-sama.

00:03:32.209 --> 00:03:37.369
I'm Rika Aragami. I'm a
Gon-Sojo and Saki's contracted monk.

00:03:38.309 --> 00:03:43.819
Senior Tagami and I both trained under
Sojo Takamine. So he was my fellow disciple.

00:03:43.819 --> 00:03:45.959
So why are you here?

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:49.829
We were making sure you weren't
going to do anything weird to Makina.

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:53.159
Anything weird?! Wh-why would I?

00:03:53.159 --> 00:03:56.299
You were telling her how
you felt about her, weren't you...

00:03:56.299 --> 00:03:58.499
What? I didn't say anything like that.

00:03:58.499 --> 00:04:01.069
I thought I have to protect the
person that Brother cared for, so...

00:04:01.069 --> 00:04:03.939
We were listening from
outside the Shikabane's trench.

00:04:03.939 --> 00:04:06.339
What are you, a child eavesdropping
outside the teachers' lounge?!

00:04:06.339 --> 00:04:08.139
What?! Who're you calling a child?!

00:04:11.309 --> 00:04:14.679
You're accepting Hoshimura's
daughter's new contract?!

00:04:14.679 --> 00:04:18.519
Now that the Seven Stars has
clearly determined that we're their target,

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:20.659
we need to strengthen our fighting power.

00:04:20.659 --> 00:04:22.519
Allowing defiled ones

00:04:22.519 --> 00:04:24.589
to enter the head temple's backyard
and purification chamber area

00:04:24.589 --> 00:04:27.299
was your people's fault, Takamine!

00:04:27.299 --> 00:04:30.199
On top of that, they were able to get away

00:04:30.199 --> 00:04:32.499
even after you sent in several
contracted monks, including a Sojo.

00:04:32.499 --> 00:04:36.609
Shikabane Hime are nothing
more than defiled ones after all.

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:40.209
What we must do is try
to renew people's spirits

00:04:40.209 --> 00:04:44.649
using the power of Buddhist
dharma in order to save all people!

00:04:44.649 --> 00:04:47.019
We don't have that kind of time!

00:04:47.019 --> 00:04:49.219
First off... what happened to Umehara?

00:04:49.219 --> 00:04:52.189
To think that one of the Sojo
who caused this blunder is absent...

00:04:52.189 --> 00:04:54.019
I gave him permission.

00:05:00.729 --> 00:05:05.469
Whether Makina Hoshimura ties a strong
bond with her current contracted monk

00:05:05.469 --> 00:05:08.999
and returns to the Kougon
Sect's philosophy or not...

00:05:08.999 --> 00:05:12.039
I ordered Umehara to see it through.

00:05:12.039 --> 00:05:16.509
If that really happens, I will
accept the entrance of Ouri Kagami,

00:05:16.509 --> 00:05:20.579
her contracted monk, to the Kougon
Sect as a Dai-Sozu or a similar rank.

00:05:20.579 --> 00:05:23.349
But that's unprecedented!

00:05:23.349 --> 00:05:27.019
Instead of relying on a Shikabane Hime,
what we need to do now is...

00:05:27.019 --> 00:05:31.049
It's hard to think that that girl can
fight against the Seven Stars alone!

00:05:34.559 --> 00:05:37.529
It's an imperial ordinance
by His Grace Dai-Sojo.

00:05:40.069 --> 00:05:44.529
From now on, you'll receive
training geared towards real battles.

00:05:45.209 --> 00:05:47.679
For your weapon, you'd like
to use a monk's staff, right?

00:05:47.679 --> 00:05:50.409
Yes. The same kind that Brother used.

00:05:50.409 --> 00:05:53.249
Of course, no matter how
much you train yourself,

00:05:53.249 --> 00:05:57.349
there's no way you can match Shikabane,
never mind the Seven Stars.

00:05:57.349 --> 00:06:03.129
But if you fall during the battle, that
means the end of your Shikabane Hime.

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:06.929
We are Shikabane Hime's
batteries, so to speak.

00:06:06.929 --> 00:06:10.769
By the way, Umehara
is as small as an N battery.

00:06:10.769 --> 00:06:13.269
- N Battery! It's small!
- Who're you calling an N Battery?!
Wait! When did you see that?

00:06:13.269 --> 00:06:15.069
- N Battery! It's small!
- No, uhm, I mean,
what're you talking about?!

00:06:15.069 --> 00:06:18.409
Anyway, the job of a
contracted monk is not to die.

00:06:18.409 --> 00:06:22.139
In order to do that, I'll have you master
the basics of handling yourself at least.

00:06:22.139 --> 00:06:23.539
Yes sir!

00:06:28.049 --> 00:06:32.889
But we need to have Makina-chan
undergo a different training before that.

00:06:32.889 --> 00:06:34.319
What?

00:06:34.319 --> 00:06:37.819
She has to break the bond
with her previous contracted monk.

00:06:53.679 --> 00:06:56.509
You're the first one up, Ena.

00:06:56.509 --> 00:06:57.609
All right!

00:06:57.609 --> 00:06:59.679
Make sure you leave that guy for me.

00:06:59.679 --> 00:07:02.749
What? Oh, that contracted monk?

00:07:02.749 --> 00:07:09.429
Well... although he doesn't
inspire my artistic mind...

00:07:09.429 --> 00:07:11.259
I can't promise that.

00:07:11.959 --> 00:07:14.699
Don't tell me you're really
having Ena-san go alone...

00:07:14.699 --> 00:07:16.699
You have a problem with me going alone?

00:07:16.699 --> 00:07:19.329
If Makina Hoshimura is an
enemy of the Seven Stars,

00:07:19.329 --> 00:07:21.969
you should choose a way
that can defeat her for sure.

00:07:21.969 --> 00:07:25.639
Our actions the other day were
simply to show our faces to her.

00:07:25.639 --> 00:07:30.849
I will defeat Makina...
using the way I feel is the most beautiful.

00:07:30.849 --> 00:07:32.649
Such a personal desire is...

00:07:32.649 --> 00:07:33.219
"Seven Stars"
Such a personal desire is...

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.979
"Seven Stars"
That's what you call nature.

00:07:34.979 --> 00:07:35.679
"Seven Stars"
Nature?

00:07:35.679 --> 00:07:35.849
Nature?

00:07:35.849 --> 00:07:41.689
I said before... that what makes us,
the Seven Stars, act isn't puny regrets.

00:07:41.689 --> 00:07:43.559
It's something more fundamental...

00:07:43.559 --> 00:07:45.989
something that lies hidden in
the depths of people's souls...

00:07:45.989 --> 00:07:49.869
something that you yourself can't control...
something that makes a man a man...

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:51.129
It's our nature.

00:07:51.129 --> 00:07:56.039
By following our nature, we can
become an existence that exceeds humans.

00:07:56.039 --> 00:07:59.369
Ena-dono is obsessed with beauty.

00:08:00.709 --> 00:08:06.349
If he thinks nothing of others' lives in
order to create something beautiful,

00:08:06.349 --> 00:08:08.519
that's his nature.

00:08:08.519 --> 00:08:10.219
Got that?

00:08:10.219 --> 00:08:16.359
We follow our own natures. Even if
we die because of that, we don't care.

00:08:16.359 --> 00:08:18.689
If you get in our way...

00:08:24.029 --> 00:08:29.039
Akasha, can you bring out
Hoshimura's daughter and the others?

00:08:29.039 --> 00:08:32.769
There's an interesting Shikabane.
Since he seemed to be useful,

00:08:32.769 --> 00:08:36.209
I kept him around without
sealing him in my casket.

00:08:36.209 --> 00:08:39.749
That Shikabane can be bait
for those surrounding Hoshimura.

00:08:39.749 --> 00:08:43.289
I see. It'll be fine even
if Hoshimura comes out.

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:48.349
Even if she doesn't, those
surrounding her will be gone, huh?

00:08:54.029 --> 00:08:58.689
Hokuto... I'll be watching you...

00:09:05.039 --> 00:09:08.199
Although these arrows are just for training,
it's gonna hurt if they hit you!

00:09:10.909 --> 00:09:14.539
You're Makina-chan's
current contracted monk, right?

00:09:14.979 --> 00:09:19.389
Other bonds will be nothing but an
obstacle when she exerts her strength.

00:09:19.389 --> 00:09:24.659
Breaking the bond doesn't
mean she'll forget Senior Tagami.

00:09:24.659 --> 00:09:27.159
It'll be a little harder
for her to remember him

00:09:27.159 --> 00:09:30.149
and she'll be less hung-up
about the past. That's all.

00:09:30.829 --> 00:09:35.669
In Makina-chan's case, there's a
reason she must break the bond at any cost.

00:09:37.469 --> 00:09:39.339
That's the "curse"!

00:09:39.339 --> 00:09:43.069
To think the bond between
Hoshimura-san and Brother is a curse!

00:09:44.179 --> 00:09:48.979
That tremendous power
you showed is your curse.

00:09:49.849 --> 00:09:54.579
A curse... Shikabane's ability to
turn a powerful obsession into power.

00:09:54.959 --> 00:09:57.189
But a Shikabane Hime having a curse

00:09:57.189 --> 00:10:00.859
means that she's become that
much closer to being a Shikabane.

00:10:00.859 --> 00:10:06.489
On top of that, she puts her contracted
monk's life in danger due to the curse.

00:10:08.469 --> 00:10:12.769
The cause of your curse is the regret
towards your previous contracted monk.

00:10:12.769 --> 00:10:17.779
You have to break that bond and
purify the remaining rotten Rune as well.

00:10:17.779 --> 00:10:19.009
Okay?

00:10:27.389 --> 00:10:29.789
Is it really okay, Makina?

00:10:30.189 --> 00:10:32.229
I will defeat the Seven Stars.

00:10:32.229 --> 00:10:37.029
That's what I've decided and
that's also Keisei's wish, so...

00:11:03.529 --> 00:11:05.889
Why am I hesitating now?

00:11:19.739 --> 00:11:23.009
Is this really what you want?

00:11:25.379 --> 00:11:28.109
Don't you have... regrets about Keisei?

00:11:29.249 --> 00:11:34.189
It's a hallucination! It's just an
illusion produced by exhaustion.

00:11:34.189 --> 00:11:38.529
What'll be left when you
give up your ties with Keisei?

00:11:38.529 --> 00:11:41.859
You don't want to lose
your bond with Keisei, right?

00:11:45.699 --> 00:11:52.109
The reason I became a Shikabane was that my
family and I were killed by the Seven Stars.

00:11:52.109 --> 00:11:54.239
So I will defeat the Seven Stars!

00:11:54.239 --> 00:11:56.779
What about Keisei?

00:11:56.779 --> 00:11:59.719
Ever since Keisei was
killed before your eyes...

00:11:59.719 --> 00:12:03.089
no, even from long before that,

00:12:03.089 --> 00:12:06.579
being with Keisei
was the reason you fought.

00:12:07.219 --> 00:12:10.279
Keisei meant everything to me...

00:12:11.759 --> 00:12:16.819
That's right. I couldn't protect him...

00:12:18.329 --> 00:12:21.399
So in order not to waste his death...

00:12:21.399 --> 00:12:24.169
You give up on Keisei? That's strange.

00:12:24.169 --> 00:12:27.409
Strange... I know that.

00:12:27.409 --> 00:12:32.969
The one you curse the most is
neither the Seven Stars nor this world.

00:12:37.319 --> 00:12:40.019
It's me myself.

00:12:53.699 --> 00:12:55.599
Makina-chan.

00:12:55.599 --> 00:12:58.209
Everything's been completed.

00:12:58.209 --> 00:13:00.039
You finished breaking the bond?

00:13:00.039 --> 00:13:01.869
- Saki!
- I know.

00:13:02.279 --> 00:13:04.009
Stop right there!

00:13:04.009 --> 00:13:06.649
A Shikabane Hime has one duty, right?

00:13:06.649 --> 00:13:09.449
To kill as many Shikabane as possible.

00:13:22.299 --> 00:13:23.699
Saki!

00:13:30.869 --> 00:13:32.069
Saki...

00:13:32.069 --> 00:13:35.409
Rika... I can't do it...

00:13:36.849 --> 00:13:39.509
Wouldn't it bother you, Rika?

00:13:39.509 --> 00:13:44.849
If you died and I forgot
my bond with you?

00:13:53.159 --> 00:13:54.659
A traffic accident?

00:13:54.659 --> 00:13:59.839
Yes. It was like, bam!
A truck just hit me... and I died.

00:13:59.839 --> 00:14:03.669
Then you didn't even
have time to hold regrets.

00:14:03.669 --> 00:14:06.579
I wondered about that at first, too.

00:14:06.579 --> 00:14:11.009
I was told that regrets and
obsessions turn people into Shikabane.

00:14:11.009 --> 00:14:14.379
But I was just an ordinary
high school student up until then.

00:14:14.879 --> 00:14:21.349
About all I liked was ice cream...
There was really nothing else.

00:14:22.189 --> 00:14:24.429
So that was my regret.

00:14:24.429 --> 00:14:25.229
What?

00:14:25.229 --> 00:14:28.199
I hadn't done anything.

00:14:28.199 --> 00:14:33.439
Things like falling in love with a boy...
taking a trip with my friends,

00:14:33.439 --> 00:14:37.769
finding something that could become
precious to me, exciting experiences...

00:14:37.769 --> 00:14:43.409
Things that girls would experience...
I hadn't done any of them yet...

00:14:43.409 --> 00:14:45.449
That was my regret.

00:14:45.449 --> 00:14:49.419
An ordinary high school student
was told to fight Shikabane.

00:14:49.419 --> 00:14:51.389
I was very scared.

00:14:51.389 --> 00:14:55.979
So I asked them to have me contract
with whoever seemed the strongest.

00:14:57.989 --> 00:15:00.499
You are Takamasa Sougi-kun, right?

00:15:00.499 --> 00:15:02.329
What?

00:15:02.329 --> 00:15:06.269
The heir to the strongest warrior
monk with the Genpaku title.

00:15:06.269 --> 00:15:08.339
Yeah... Who are you?

00:15:08.339 --> 00:15:09.499
Show me your hand.

00:15:09.499 --> 00:15:10.799
Hm?

00:15:13.509 --> 00:15:14.339
Ow, ow, ow!

00:15:14.339 --> 00:15:17.949
- I'm hurt! I'm hurt!
You bit me! It's bleeding!
- Hey, be quiet!

00:15:17.949 --> 00:15:22.579
We are those who lost awareness and
the key, those who prostrate ourselves...

00:15:22.579 --> 00:15:27.249
uhm... those who journey
inside the philosophy.

00:15:33.359 --> 00:15:35.919
Now we have a contract.

00:15:36.499 --> 00:15:40.339
From now on, you're my
contracted monk, Takamasa.

00:15:40.339 --> 00:15:41.369
Okay?

00:15:41.369 --> 00:15:46.509
I'm a powerless Shikabane Hime,
but I'll protect you with all my might, so...

00:15:46.509 --> 00:15:51.309
Uhm, Contracted monk and
Shikabane Hime... What're you talking about?

00:15:53.519 --> 00:15:57.219
Because Takamasa Sougi's father
died without telling him anything,

00:15:57.219 --> 00:16:02.349
he was nothing but a high school
student who'd never even been in a fight.

00:16:03.559 --> 00:16:06.359
Stupid! You're naturally spacey! Goofball!

00:16:06.359 --> 00:16:09.999
You're incredible, Itsuki! You're so moe!

00:16:09.999 --> 00:16:12.469
I wonder if she's praising me...

00:16:14.539 --> 00:16:21.199
Checking the restoration level of Shikabane
Hime is also an important duty as a Sojo.

00:16:24.709 --> 00:16:28.149
When I heard that Hoshimura-san
was going to break her bond with Brother,

00:16:28.149 --> 00:16:32.719
even though I knew how
tough it would be for her...

00:16:32.719 --> 00:16:36.519
somewhere in my heart, I was relieved.

00:16:40.399 --> 00:16:44.569
Since I know I can't have a
relationship with her like Brother did...

00:16:44.569 --> 00:16:47.029
since I can't be a match for Brother...

00:16:47.669 --> 00:16:53.369
I'm relieved to hear that
she's breaking the bond.

00:16:55.039 --> 00:16:56.679
Takamasa!

00:16:56.679 --> 00:16:59.839
Did you tell Itsuki-chan your feelings yet?

00:17:02.079 --> 00:17:05.949
Ouri... You're forgetting
one important thing.

00:17:05.949 --> 00:17:07.019
What?

00:17:07.019 --> 00:17:11.229
You have to understand that the
girl before you is a Shikabane Hime...

00:17:11.229 --> 00:17:18.469
that she's no longer a human. She's an
aberration that exists only to kill Shikabane...

00:17:18.469 --> 00:17:19.869
Aberration?

00:17:23.039 --> 00:17:27.109
These're the price I paid the
time that I didn't understand that.

00:17:27.109 --> 00:17:32.439
I didn't notice that until I
lost many precious things.

00:17:34.119 --> 00:17:39.149
Shikabane Hime are aberrations.
They gained power by dying.

00:17:39.149 --> 00:17:42.589
But at the same time, that
means they turned into aberrations,

00:17:42.589 --> 00:17:45.559
something that can never be human.

00:17:45.559 --> 00:17:51.469
What do you want from a
Shikabane Hime? Power? Or...

00:17:53.229 --> 00:17:58.009
Unfortunately, you can never
gain both of them at the same time.

00:17:58.009 --> 00:18:01.409
In order to gain the power
called Shikabane Hime...

00:18:01.409 --> 00:18:06.349
You have to give up what you
have in your heart right now.

00:18:06.349 --> 00:18:07.819
Noooo! My god!

00:18:07.819 --> 00:18:09.019
What?! What was that?

00:18:09.019 --> 00:18:11.319
Ah, don't worry.

00:18:11.319 --> 00:18:15.189
Itsuki and Flesh caught Master sneaking into the
women's bath to do his dirty checkup on them

00:18:15.189 --> 00:18:20.459
and they're doing something very
embarrassing to him. That's all.

00:18:20.459 --> 00:18:22.759
Something embarrassing?

00:18:22.759 --> 00:18:26.529
He's really hopeless.
I guess I'll go collect him.

00:18:30.609 --> 00:18:33.339
But... I...

00:18:36.109 --> 00:18:41.819
You may in fact be a lot
more like that woman...

00:18:41.819 --> 00:18:45.949
Is it wrong for me to see
Hoshimura-san as an ordinary girl?

00:18:45.949 --> 00:18:50.559
Isn't it about time for you
to remember what you are?

00:18:50.559 --> 00:18:53.219
Wait! What do you mean?!

00:18:53.859 --> 00:18:56.869
Ouri Kagami... I have a favor to ask.

00:18:56.869 --> 00:18:58.799
Hoshimura-san...

00:18:58.799 --> 00:19:01.899
Please... quit being my contracted monk.

00:19:01.899 --> 00:19:03.569
What?! Why?

00:19:03.569 --> 00:19:05.909
Because you lack ability.

00:19:05.909 --> 00:19:10.009
If you don't have a contracted monk,
you can't exert your strength!

00:19:10.009 --> 00:19:12.249
I do have a contracted monk.

00:19:12.249 --> 00:19:17.209
I have the curse... that Keisei left for me...

00:19:17.889 --> 00:19:20.689
But you can't endure this curse.

00:19:20.689 --> 00:19:23.559
I... I will fight, too!

00:19:23.559 --> 00:19:28.999
You're a burden to me.
You fight because of me, right?!

00:19:28.999 --> 00:19:30.899
But I'm saying that it's not necessary.

00:19:30.899 --> 00:19:32.369
No!

00:19:38.869 --> 00:19:41.009
You don't understand, do you...

00:19:41.009 --> 00:19:43.009
If you get injuries
that you can't recover from,

00:19:43.009 --> 00:19:46.669
you will no longer be
accepted as a contracted monk.

00:19:48.049 --> 00:19:49.679
Even so, no.

00:19:49.679 --> 00:19:51.389
I see...

00:19:51.389 --> 00:19:53.849
Then I have no choice.

00:19:57.629 --> 00:20:00.459
Zadan technique,
Golden Claw Phenomenal Palm!

00:20:01.359 --> 00:20:04.199
These strings are an
extension of my nerve system.

00:20:04.199 --> 00:20:06.769
They trace even the
subtlest movements accurately

00:20:06.769 --> 00:20:10.299
and control the opponent's
body down to each muscle.

00:20:11.639 --> 00:20:13.539
I won't let you get away this time!

00:20:28.259 --> 00:20:30.329
How long do we have to keep her like this?

00:20:30.329 --> 00:20:31.829
I don't know.

00:20:31.829 --> 00:20:37.259
But if she stays cursed,
she's useless as a Shikabane Hime.

00:20:42.969 --> 00:20:46.169
I verified it with the records.
This is the one from four years ago.

00:20:47.409 --> 00:20:49.679
No mistake about it?

00:20:49.679 --> 00:20:50.969
Okay.

00:20:53.079 --> 00:20:55.069
Takamasa?

00:20:55.679 --> 00:20:58.149
After four long years...

00:21:00.759 --> 00:21:02.119
Where're we going?!

00:21:02.119 --> 00:21:04.789
A Shikabane appeared in our district.

00:21:04.789 --> 00:21:06.929
I'll be with Hoshimura-san.

00:21:06.929 --> 00:21:10.489
You saw it, right?
Makina Hoshimura's aberration...

00:21:14.539 --> 00:21:20.009
I recognized that my Shikabane Hime
is an aberration and accepted it.

00:21:20.009 --> 00:21:23.949
I am off to the battle in which I will prove it.

00:21:23.949 --> 00:21:26.379
You should see it, too.

00:21:32.019 --> 00:21:32.949
Dammit!

00:21:39.289 --> 00:21:43.459
Not only the Seven Stars...
but also a Shikabane like this...

00:21:48.839 --> 00:21:50.799
Takamasa!

00:21:55.139 --> 00:22:02.819
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:22:02.819 --> 00:22:06.849
I've just taken a big step forward

00:22:06.849 --> 00:22:14.529
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:22:14.529 --> 00:22:22.439
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:22:25.169 --> 00:22:30.949
"Is there a future where I'm headed?"

00:22:30.949 --> 00:22:36.879
I asked the gray sky above

00:22:36.879 --> 00:22:42.719
I can move forward only by fighting

00:22:42.719 --> 00:22:48.529
I live life ineptly, as it's the only way I know

00:22:48.529 --> 00:22:53.599
So I'm constantly struggling

00:22:53.599 --> 00:23:01.379
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:23:01.379 --> 00:23:05.409
I've just taken a big step forward

00:23:05.409 --> 00:23:13.089
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:23:13.089 --> 00:23:20.959
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:23:25.299 --> 00:23:29.739
The lips that once
whispered love now shout...

00:23:29.739 --> 00:23:33.939
"Don't look at me!
Don't come!"many, many times...

00:23:33.939 --> 00:23:39.969
Even then, is it still hard for
you not to look at "Itsuki's form"?
